<title>USA: Hillenbrand unit receives trust charter.</title>
<headline>Hillenbrand unit receives trust charter.</headline>
<dateline>BATESVILLE, Ind. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hillenbrand Industries Inc's Forecorp Inc unit said Tuesday it has secured a national trust charter from the U.S. government.</p>
<p>The charter will allow Forecorp's Forethought National TrustBank to make available trust-based funeral planning products to funeral directors to market, Hillenbrand said.</p>
<p>The trust products will complement life insurance-based products, in situations where those products are not available or less desirable, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
